<view class="page page-enter"><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">选择具体课程 *</text><picker range="{{sessions}}" range-key="title" value="{{sessionIndex}}" bindchange="session"><view class="picker">{{sessions.length ? sessions[sessionIndex].title + ' · ' + sessions[sessionIndex].date + ' ' + sessions[sessionIndex].time : '暂无可预约课程'}}</view></picker><view class="muted small hint">体验课必须绑定一节正式课程，系统自动带入班级、教练、场地和日期。</view></view><view class="field" wx:if="{{sessions.length}}"><text class="field-label">课程信息</text><view class="picker">{{sessions[sessionIndex].venue}} · {{sessions[sessionIndex].coach.name || sessions[sessionIndex].coachName}}</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">备注</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{remark}}" bindinput="remark" placeholder="首次体验、家长关注点等"/></view><view class="notice">体验学员只进入本节课程的“体验学员”区域，不创建classMember、不扣lessonLedger、不进入候补。</view></view><button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{!sessions.length}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">确认预约体验课</button></view>

